{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-17T07:50:21.872Z","author":"pi-guard-1117aj","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"48527023785f74f648c65603","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/8","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-17T07:50:21.871Z","author":"pi-guard-1117aj","text":"Round AJ: merged origin/main (kept both sides; the selfhost bundle is a regenerated artifact and is rewritten by the self-host gate at HEAD; no history lines rewritten), then replaced the guard's shell parser with a line-based fail-closed rule identical to the other fleet repositories: logical lines only (continuations joined, newline-only splits), comment and here-document text scanned like any other text, install family extended with update/up/upgrade/udpate, markers covering single-dash g clusters, global-containing tokens, -L with any value and two-plus-letter prefixes of global/location, npm config set/set as a run-wide global signal (narrowed to a set token: a read-only 'npm config get globalconfig' line tripped the broader form), operands naming npm by substring or computed form (tarball URLs, x@npm:npm), exemptions restricted to exact approved bootstrap lines, and step-level rejection of GITHUB_ENV npm_config_* writes and global/location npmrc writes. The accepted npx fixture moved to rejected (thread PRRT_kwDOToJT7M64II4P): the rule scans quoted text, so npx-prefixed and echoed global installs can no longer hide. Both guard and release-approval test files now import the session isolation helper first (thread PRRT_kwDOToJT7M64GMoi), and the release-approval test also asserts the bootstrap appends the same prefix's node_modules/.bin to $GITHUB_PATH and that the Verify job-local npm version step expects exactly the installed version."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-17T07:50:21.872Z"}],"before_hash":"acf1dd95974a7f3890a1b4c779f78e71667609922a5d2c3c1196acc81b270774","after_hash":"7d38b75c7e22f117c021df80e37c610d44871904e4eb9cf52020961fcbc389d1","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"94093867dd5ff8be4e0a66de9ac3d2584afdd288fbcd220c6b4de8643db70f6a"}
